{"id":"637320","name":"捆蹄","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637320/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蹄膀","amount":"一个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香料包","amount":"一个"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"山楂","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"甜面酱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好一个蹄髈，清洗干净。","img":"images/637320/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把中间的骨头剃出来。","img":"images/637320/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打上花刀。","img":"images/637320/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"清洗干净，泡一个小时，去除血水。","img":"images/637320/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"凉水上锅，加姜片和葱、料酒，焯水。","img":"images/637320/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮10分钟，撇去浮沫。","img":"images/637320/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出，用温水清洗干净。","img":"images/637320/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"转入电压力锅中，加入辅料和调料中所有的食材和煮蹄髈的原汤。","img":"images/637320/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上锅盖，压30分钟。","img":"images/637320/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出蹄髈，用一块干净的布，包好，捆紧(也可以用保鲜膜)。","img":"images/637320/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"卷成圆柱形，放入冰箱冷藏一个晚上。","img":"images/637320/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"冷藏好的蹄髈，取出。","img":"images/637320/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"拆开。","img":"images/637320/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切片。","img":"images/637320/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"摆盘，即可食用。","img":"images/637320/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637320/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637320/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637320/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637320/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}